# Supplementary USB state feedback for configfs=2 (gadget HAL) mode.
# Mirrors sys.usb.config to sys.usb.state so the framework's
# waitForState() can complete without 1s timeout.
#
# Only triggers on explicit property changes (framework setUsbConfig),
# not on initial boot — the framework handles the initial config
# sequence via setEnabledFunctions.

on property:sys.usb.config=* && property:sys.usb.configfs=2 && property:sys.boot_completed=1
    setprop sys.usb.state ${sys.usb.config}
